{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in Egypt, Back To Back, <u>an exclusively co-op linear adventure</u>\u00a0where you follow the adventure of 3 pairs of characters through different time periods.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After 1992's Cairo's earthquake, Restorations of pharaonic tombs have started. In one of the restorations, a pair of archaeologists will reactivate a talisman dating back to 1570 B.C that will reshape modern day as we know it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Theme</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by Egyptian papyrus, 1990s comics and modern day indie games, the game will shift from one visual style to the other depending on the era of the current level. Making use of the Egyptian setting in environment and sound track choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304730/extras/hero_cropped.png?t=1742762972\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Work together to survive\u00a0</strong>- Use teamwork to solve puzzles and overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience various mechanics</strong> -\u00a0 from <i>How would you survive an apocalypse with only one gun</i>\u00a0to <i>We have to time our jump together to avoid traps</i>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">THIS PRODUCT IS CO-OP ONLY.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304730?t=1742762972","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304730?t=1742762972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304730/7e7070d953757cc7bcdd5fc19b7825543798c0b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742762972","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/